---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | pestcontrolcorneliusnc"
  description="Privacy policy for pestcontrolcorneliusnc.us. How we collect, use, and protect information submitted through our website."
  canonical="/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: March 2025</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy describes how pestcontrolcorneliusnc ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and shares information when you visit pestcontrolcorneliusnc.us or contact us through the website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit a contact or quote request form, we collect the information you provide, such as your name, email address, phone number, property location, and details about your pest concern. We also collect standard server log information and may use cookies or similar technologies for basic site functionality and analytics.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use the information you provide to respond to your inquiries, schedule services, improve our website, and communicate with you about your requests. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Form Submissions</h2>
        <p>
          Contact form submissions are processed through Web3Forms or a similar form handling service. Their privacy practices apply to data in transit and storage on their systems. We receive the form contents in order to respond to you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may use analytics tools and font providers that collect limited technical data. We select providers that respect user privacy to the extent practical for a small business website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain inquiry information for as long as needed to provide service and for reasonable business record-keeping. You may request deletion of your contact information by emailing us.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Your Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may choose not to submit personal information through our forms. If you do submit information, you may contact us to update or request deletion of the data we hold about you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy-related questions, contact us through the form on our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline">Contact page</a> or write to us at the address listed on that page.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
